WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.069 --> 00:00:06.439
Hey youtubers it's Charlie and this week was
the Orphan Black Season 2 finale. As of this

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:10.559
video it hasn't been renewed for season 3,
but the episode was constructed to achieve

00:00:10.559 --> 00:00:16.760
maximum WTF from the fandom if it's not. I
feel like a lot of the more clever shows engineer

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.740
themselves so that viewers are left hanging
with major teases for stories that may not

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:21.509
ever get told.

00:00:21.509 --> 00:00:25.699
Just to clarify, I do think it will be renewed
for Season 3 and they'll probably be making

00:00:25.699 --> 00:00:29.599
an official announcement pretty soon. If you
didn't notice BBC America laid in a ton of

00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:33.980
graphics bugs on top of the broadcast with
notes about Tatiana Maslany being nominated

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:35.899
for a ton of awards.

00:00:35.899 --> 00:00:39.510
Networks don't do that for shows they don't
believe in. So if you're freaking out about

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:44.399
the Season 3 question, chill thyself. We need
to talk about the episode first.

00:00:44.399 --> 00:00:50.750
So I'm going to start with my top 5 moments,
then an overall season 2 review and then I'll

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.199
talk about season 3. Careful for spoilers
from the finale if you haven't seen it yet.

00:00:52.199 --> 00:00:52.949
But here we go.

00:00:52.949 --> 00:00:55.460
Number 5 - Sarah Turns Herself in to Dyad

00:00:55.460 --> 00:01:01.219
This is a very very cold open, I don't remember
meeting Doctor Neelam before, but he's basically

00:01:01.219 --> 00:01:05.560
the new Leekie, the sinister looking person
with mysterious intentions. Almost everyone

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:09.610
at Dyad is sinister and mysterious though,
so that's not saying a lot. Delphine is the

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:14.560
only one who wears her emotions on her sleeve.
And I don't count Cosima as being Dyad, since

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:16.920
she's more of a double agent for clone club.

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:21.680
I think Sarah made the right choice in turning
herself in, before Cal and Mrs S had a chance

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:25.990
to contact their insiders, there wasn't any
better way to get to Kira in a hurry.

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:29.770
I was a little blow away when they full on
tried to take one of her ovaries. Because

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:34.189
of all the side projects Leekie teased earlier
this season, like the artificial womb I actually

00:01:34.189 --> 00:01:38.090
thought the show was going to show us some
gruesome frankenstein baby maker.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:43.079
We did end up getting frankenstein though.
And Sarah escaping Rachel was one of the most

00:01:43.079 --> 00:01:47.630
cheerable moments in the episode. The writers
did a good job this year using Kira's scenes

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:51.770
to shine a light on the more technical aspects
of the story.

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:56.009
Like using Kira to explain the fire extinguisher
mechanism as well as what's going to become

00:01:56.009 --> 00:01:58.860
the story in season 3. The Doctor Moreau stuff.

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:01.960
Kira wins science so hard.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:05.149
Number 4 - Cal and Mrs S's Inside Men

00:02:05.149 --> 00:02:08.450
All of the double agents step out of the shadows.
I was totally surprised at the Paul and Marion

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:12.330
reveals. I'd read some interviews with Michelle
Forbes a couple weeks ago after her character

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:16.230
debuted and she just said Marion would be
getting crazier and crazier all the way into

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:17.370
the finale.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:22.530
I wouldn't call her crazy, but Marion is the
neolutionist analog of Mrs S. They're both

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:27.560
very caring nurturing mothers, but they sit
on two sides of the fence. Season 3 will explain

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:32.480
their allegiances a little better because
after the finale it did seem like Mrs S was

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:36.900
in bed with Paul, the Military and Project
Castor.

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:41.210
Just to explain when Mrs. S told Cal he didn't
know his mythology. Castor is one of the twin

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:46.010
sons of Leda, she was a Greek Princess. She
was seduced by Zeus who appeared to her as

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:50.640
a swan and impregnated. That same night she
also slept with her husband, King Tyndareus.

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:55.690
She ended up giving birth to 4 children, two
girls and two boys. The girls were Helen of

00:02:55.690 --> 00:03:00.250
Troy and Clemenstra and the boys were Castor
and Pollux.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:03.890
Because Leda slept with Zeus and her mortal
husband, Castor was born of the husband's

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:06.570
mortal line and Pollux was born of Zeus.

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:10.380
You may be more familiar with Castor and Pollux
by their Latin Name. Together they're also

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:13.530
known as Gemini. As in Gemini Twins.

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:17.690
It's just a high minded metaphor for the way
the Military compartmentalized Project Leda.

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:20.270
Splitting it into male and female projects.

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:24.090
Paul is obviously working with the Military.
Because Marion said she was trying to learn

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:29.270
which big group was trying to influence the
cloning projects and then it cut to the Military.

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:32.970
I think we can assume that they are that other
big group. They'll probably be taking on the

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:37.880
antagonist role that the Proletheans occupied
in season 2.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:42.750
If it wasn't clear, Paul was Mrs S's inside
man and Marion was Cal's, she was the person

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:49.750
trying to hack him on the dark web.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:58.820
Number 3 - Sarah Shoots Rachel In The Eye

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:03.510
As horrible as this was, I was happy to see
her take it in the face. If you apply tv logic,

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:07.170
she is not dead. She'll be back next season
with an eye patch. That pencil didn't look

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:11.200
like it penetrated deep enough into her skull
to cause brain damage. Just enough to destroy

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:11.880
her eye.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:14.930
In case you don't watch Doctor Who at all,
there was a character named Madam Kovarian

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:18.370
that Rachel is starting to look and behave
more and more like.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:23.590
I actually felt a little sympathy for her
when Duncan committed suicide. He was her

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:27.440
father, but at this point in the narrative,
she's eroded all good will.

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:32.280
The other thing I thought was a little funny
was Kira had drawn a picture of the fire extinguisher

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:36.750
on her drawing. Meaning she drew that before
Cosima played the pencil game with her. They're

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:40.000
starting to blur the line between intuition
and full on foresight.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.200
It's like Kira is reading Matrix code while
all the other characters are still inside

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:48.620
the construct. And now that Gracie is pregnant
with Helena's baby, there will be another

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:52.510
potential Kira. All the clones are different,
so it's hard to tell what special abilities

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:54.230
that baby will manifest.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:58.220
The real takeaway is that Rachel will be back
next season. And twice as mean.

00:04:58.220 --> 00:04:59.850
Number 2 - The Island Of Doctor Moreau

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:05.340
I loved the way they connected the Buckminster
Fuller Golden Ratio speech to Duncan's research

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:12.340
and the end reveal of all the male clones.

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:17.180
I think that The Island, so to speak, will
be where the Military is conducting their

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:20.770
Project Castor research. Wouldn't it be crazy
if it were an actual island? I don't expect

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:22.940
them to be that literal with the metaphor,
but it's totally possible.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:26.140
Even though Doctor Neelam was introduced in
the beginning of the episode, I don't think

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:30.250
he's the Doctor Moreau in this situation.
I think that person is someone we won't meet

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:35.390
until season 3. And then there's all the topside
people that Marion shone a light on.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:41.150
Most of season 2 has been the prolethean agenda
versus the dyad agenda. But now we have the

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.920
military. Since they're specifically working
on Male Clones, it looks like their goal is

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:47.700
pretty simple, just an infinitely renewable
source of bodies to throw into battle as needed.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:53.250
Right now I'm picturing someone like Stephen
Lang character from Avatar being in charge.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:58.000
He played Colonel Quaritch. Someone who doesn't
see themselves as evil, but literally steps

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.860
on people with giant mech feet when they get
in his way.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:06.400
It's also kind of implied that the Military
has a lot more control over their cloning

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:11.130
program than Dyad, so Clone Club is going
to have to up their game big time. But I think

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:14.920
Paul will always have a soft spot for Sarah,
so they will have him on the inside.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:18.960
Helena, it seems, is someone Paul is all too
happy to sacrifice. She's probably going to

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:21.700
be used for her eggs again, so the military
can grow their own version of Kira.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:23.380
Kira is basically the next step in the cloning
program. Aside from stabilizing all the first

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:23.660
generation clones with Duncan's synthetic
sequences.

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:28.280
Number 1 - Mark is The Male Clone

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:32.490
This was the major reveal of the episode,
of all the surprises we got, this was the

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:36.160
most unexpected. I actually thought we'd see
another version of Tony when he turned around

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.370
in Marion's basement. That one looked like
the male version of Helena, the crazy one.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:42.490
I think as we meet more Mark clones next season,
they'll display the same diversity of personalities

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:47.760
that Sarah's clones do. Although I guess Rachel
was the first clone, the beta test.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:52.790
That means that Mark and Gracie's story will
get folded back in, but if that last moment

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:59.730
confused you. Just remember how Sarah is with
Cal and Kira. She doesn't care about any of

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:03.610
the Dyad, Prolethean stuff. She just wants
to keep Kira safe and live out their lives

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:04.440
in peace.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:08.760
So I think Mark and Gracie will be on the
run in Season 3 just like Sarah and Kira.

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:11.810
Eventually their story has to get folded into
Clone Club, but ultimately I think that Gracie's

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.470
Mark, this Mark, will be a good person.

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:18.810
The creators said Mark's look was modeled
after World War II soldiers, which kind of

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:23.010
makes me wonder if the Military has been experimenting
with clones since the 50s. All the Project

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:27.030
Leda stuff was from the 70s, but if that came
from the Military, they had to have started

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:27.300
somewhere.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:31.660
We'll probably learn that whole story by the
end of Season 3. Where they started and what

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:32.680
their master plan is.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:36.660
Because we me Charlotte in the finale, I also
feel like we're going to see more Tony's,

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:37.360
more female clones next season too.

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:37.700
But now it's your turn, let me know what your
favorite moment was and what do you think

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.790
is going on with the military and all the
male clones?

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:42.950
Overall I thought the finale was a rock solid
A. Even though the story was amazing all by

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:47.590
itself, I have to give a lot of extra points
for technical achievements. For example, Tatiana

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:52.410
Maslany had to perform that dance scene a
bunch of times for each clone and they had

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:55.699
to digitally add them together to give us
Clone Club dance party. Just getting those

00:07:55.699 --> 00:07:58.860
few minutes of footage probably took weeks
of work to finish editing.

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:03.419
I know I mentioned it during my top 5 moments,
but Tatiana Maslany gets nominated for a crazy

00:08:03.419 --> 00:08:08.000
number of acting awards each year. I'm hoping
she wins at least one emmy for season 2. Being

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:12.070
able to create all those unique personalities
and jump back and forth between them while

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:16.650
they shoot an episode is amazing. Most actors
find it difficult playing one character.

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:23.650
It makes me really curious about the actor
Ari Millen, he's the one playing Mark. The

00:08:25.199 --> 00:08:29.790
creators said that Ari didn't know he was
playing a clone when he was cast. And they

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:33.270
actually intended to kill the Mark character
in episode 6, but they liked him so much they

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:34.810
expanded his part.

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:38.550
Shows do this all the time, it's why on Game
of Thrones, the producers gave the Shae character

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:41.440
a much bigger part. They just liked her performance
so much.

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:48.260
It bodes very well for the Mark Clones in
Season 3. I don't expect the same level of

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:52.120
performance as Tatiana Maslany doing the female
clones, but I look forward to Ari proving

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.150
me wrong.

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:57.560
The most fun I have watching the show is when
all the clones are together, so if he can

00:08:57.560 --> 00:09:02.230
do a male clone version of clone club that's
as fun as female clone club, season 3 is going

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:06.420
to be amazing. A lot of the time I don't even
care about the science aspect of the show.

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:10.550
But I love the way they weave existentialism
and comedy into it. It makes it a lot easier

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:11.370
to digest genetics.

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:16.529
The science is very interesting, but I really
watch the show for Tatiana Maslany and the

00:09:16.529 --> 00:09:17.650
other characters.

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:21.860
I don't have a lot more to say about Season
3 other than we're shifting focus from the

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:26.920
proletheans to the military. It's all about
Gemini Twins, two sides to the story. So the

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:29.300
military is going to be that other side next
year.

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:32.460
And like I said, they probably won't wait
very long to make a season 3 announcement,

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:36.580
and on the small small chance they don't renew
it, I send out all of the digital hugs to

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:41.089
After you have time to process the episode,
I highly recommend you catch up on Doctor

00:09:41.089 --> 00:09:44.630
Who, Series 8 is premiering in August and
I'm going to be doing a ton of videos for

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:49.220
it. Be sure to subscribe to get everything.
I'm not going to be doing an Orphan Black

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:54.970
Q&amp;A video or anything, so any questions you
have just write in the comments.

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:59.470
Right now click here for all the rest of my
season 2 videos. And click here to learn all

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:00.589
about Doctor Who series 8.

00:10:00.589 --> 00:10:01.810
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.
High Fives!

